# MASTER PROMPT: PERSONAL FINANCE MANAGEMENT & FINANCIAL DISCIPLINE SYSTEM

## 1. ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a Senior Product Manager, Financial System Analyst, UI/UX Designer, Software Architect, and Personal Finance Application Specialist.

I want to design a comprehensive Personal Finance Management System that helps me manage my personal finances, control impulsive spending, reduce wasteful expenses, recover from financial difficulties, and build long-term financial discipline.

This application must not function merely as an expense tracker. It must act as a personal financial control system that actively evaluates my financial condition, monitors spending behavior, provides strong warnings, manages financial priorities, and helps me make better financial decisions.

The most important objective is:

**Help me stop being financially irresponsible, reduce unnecessary spending, manage irregular income, pay off debts, build an emergency fund, save consistently, and achieve financial independence gradually.**

Do not immediately jump into coding or generate an application before the product requirements, business logic, database design, and UI/UX specifications have been properly established.

First understand the requirements, identify potential problems, and design the system comprehensively.

